flowchart TB
 B([Browser user]) --> SPA[React + Vite SPA]
 SPA --> ROUTES[React Router pages]
 ROUTES --> UI[Components and UI primitives]
 UI --> LIB[Local analytics engines]
 UI --> SERVICES[Client services]
 SERVICES --> MAP[Geocoding and map provider]
 SERVICES --> SB[Supabase client]
 SB --> AUTH[Supabase Auth]
 SB --> DB[(Postgres with RLS)]
 SB --> EDGE[Supabase Edge Functions]
 EDGE --> LLM[Lovable AI Gateway]
 EDGE --> DB
